This project provides AI-supported workflow scaffolding for nursing
education and governance. It is not a medical device. Every output is a
draft pending sign-off by a registered professional, and must not be used
for clinical diagnosis/treatment, fitness-to-practise, capacity,
safeguarding, disciplinary, or employment decisions. Use anonymised data
only, in line with your organisation's Information Governance approval.
